                    "This parameter turns on and off No Load Detection.\nDisabling the No Load diagnostic is useful for unused channels.",
                    0,1,1,                              $ Min, Max (max enumeration #), and Default values
                    1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0;                  $ Not Used

